 "words": 248,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Year after year we went up to Shiloh",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Year after year I came home with empty arms",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Peninnah's children running round the table",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And every word she said cut deep and sharp",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Elkanah asked me why my heart was heavy",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Am I not more to you than ten sons",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With tears I poured my prayer out at the doorpost of the LORD",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My lips were moving but no sound came out",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Eli watched my mouth and thought that I was drunk",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No, my lord",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am a woman in deep distress",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I have been pouring out my soul before the LORD",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Go in peace",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And may the God of Israel grant what you have asked of him",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My heart exults in the LORD",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the LORD my horn is lifted high",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No one is holy like the LORD",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "There is none besides you",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And no rock like our God",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD remembered me and gave me a son",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I named him Samuel, for I had asked",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I asked the LORD for him",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When he was weaned I brought him to the temple",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To the very place I stood and wept and prayed",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I prayed for this child",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the LORD has granted me what I asked of him",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My heart exults in the LORD",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the LORD my horn is lifted high",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No one is holy like the LORD",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "There is none besides you",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And no rock like our God",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
